        <composition id="22" name="num-it-0" informations="num-it:&#10;This is a number iterator from nb ($1). You can increment the number by sending a new dummy data to next or decrement by sending a new dummy data to previous.&#10;&#10;The out number is limited by min and max value:&#10;min &lt; out.num &lt; max"/>
